# Pavel's Research (Q120), cond 12 to 19: Pavel's research report in hand, the character goes from
# the stones to Wendy, Doctor Chaos's bookshelf (the lockup report; the shelf's cast at the
# character is q120_pavels_research_shelf_cast) and Yumi, who gives and takes the key of enigma;
# the east weather master's riddles end at cond 19. Q114 is a completed stub, so the stones, Wendy and Yumi go through the
# quest chooser. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q120_pavels_research_east.golden
character Researcher 50
quest Q114_ResurrectionOfAnOldManager <state>=COMPLETED
quest Q120_PavelsResearch <cond>=12 <state>=STARTED
hold 8059 1
stub quest.Q114_ResurrectionOfAnOldManager
script quest.Q120_PavelsResearch
